          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our teen books were created to provide the mental tools and ideas that most teens lack in today’s society. Instead of “keeping up with” status-obsessed influencers, actors, or trivia, your teens will be reading about some of the <strong>most important ideas and people from history.</strong> </p><p>Each guidebook explores a central theme by going through many different examples. They’re designed to help teens <strong>think for themselves</strong> and <strong>learn from the past</strong>.</p>",
